patch.

── ROUND 131: no probe — a register row that was accurate when written and never struck through ──── ROUND 131: no probe — a register row that was accurate when written and never struck through ──
No product code changed. Round 130's check-up said the eleven open deviations were all deliberate trade-offs, so
this round measured whether each still holds. The first one did not: §7 row 4 said `blender_asset_ingest` was
unregistered, while the roster has it — sixteen model-visible tools, one of them this. The row was accurate when
