The row is struck through, and `docs-consistency.test.mjs` gained a NARROW check: an open row that names a
`blender_*` tool and claims it is unregistered must not name one the roster contains. Narrow on purpose — the
register also has a row about the workbench's approval-respond ROUTE, which really is unregistered (measured:
